  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodian Living Arts: Civic Participation through Arts in Cambodia 2021-2024 - Cambodian Living Arts: Civic Participation through Arts in Cambodia 2022-2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Cambodian Living Arts: Medborgardeltagande genom konst i Kambodja 2021-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives of the intervention are to strengthen the right to freedom of expression, to enable people to exercise their cultural rights  especially the right to artistic creativity, to express, share and discuss in the public sphere diverse narratives and perspectives on Cambodia&apos;s social, political and cultural contexts and to explore the potential of civic participation via the arts in Cambodia</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives of the intervention are to strengthen the right to freedom of expression, to enable people to exercise their cultural rights especially the right to artistic creativity, to express, share and discuss in the public sphere diverse narratives and perspectives on Cambodia&apos;s social, political and cultural contexts and to explore the potential of civic participation via the arts in Cambodia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka r&#xe4;tten till yttrandefrihet, g&#xf6;ra det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor att ut&#xf6;va sina kulturella r&#xe4;ttigheter, s&#xe4;rskilt r&#xe4;tten till konstn&#xe4;rlig kreativitet, att uttrycka, dela och diskutera olika ber&#xe4;ttelser och perspektiv p&#xe5; Kambodjas sociala, politiska och kulturella sammanhang i den offentliga sf&#xe4;ren och att utforska potentialen f&#xf6;r medborgardeltagande via konsten i Kambodja.</narrative>
  </description>
